Package: com.duoface.carplay.nativescenehost
Name: DuoFace Native Dashboard Scene Host (Development)
Version: 0.0.2~nativecontent1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Development
Maintainer: DuoFace Independent
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0)
Description: Independent first-party UIKit app with a real CarPlay UIWindowScene role and scene lifecycle handlers. Uses only a UIKit-provided window, never shows/moves the system Dock, and does NOT spoof admission or claim two interactive apps; includes a fail-closed opt-in CAContext content receiver inside UIKit-issued CarPlay scene. Developer staging package: not published to Sileo until admission path has safety gate.
